        <span>Additions</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Construction</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Windows &amp; Doors</span><i>&#9670;</i>
      </span>
      <span class="marquee__group" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Trim</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Cabinets</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Remodeling</span><i>&#9670;</i>
        <span>Additions</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Construction</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Windows &amp; Doors</span><i>&#9670;</i>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== AEO answer block (extractable LLM answer) ===== -->
  <aside class="aeo-answer" aria-label="Quick answer">
    <p><strong>ProBrothers Construction remodels bathrooms in <a href="/locations/media/">Media, PA</a> and across Delaware County.</strong> With 15+ years and a 5.0 rating, we handle full gut renovations, tile work, vanity installs, shower and tub upgrades, and accessible bathroom conversions. Licensed and insured in Pennsylvania. Free quote within one business day.</p>
  </aside>

  <!-- ===== What Is Bathroom Remodeling ===== -->
  <section class="section svc-overview" id="what-is-bathroom-remodeling" aria-label="What Is Bathroom Remodeling">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-overview__grid">
        <div class="svc-overview__content reveal" data-reveal="left">
          <span class="section__kicker">SERVICE OVERVIEW</span>
          <h2 class="section__title">
            Bathroom Remodeling in Media, PA
            <svg class="blueprint" viewBox="0 0 160 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
              <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
              <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            </svg>
          </h2>
          <p class="svc-overview__para">A bathroom remodel is the process of updating, redesigning, or completely rebuilding a bathroom — from cosmetic refreshes like new tile and fixtures to full gut renovations that reconfigure the layout, plumbing, and lighting. In Delaware County, PA, bathroom remodels typically range from <strong>$8,000 to $35,000</strong> depending on scope, materials, and size. ProBrothers Construction has completed 135+ residential projects across <a href="/locations/media/">Media</a>, <a href="/locations/west-chester/">West Chester</a>, <a href="/locations/glen-mills/">Glen Mills</a>, and the Main Line since 2009.</p>
          <p class="svc-overview__para">Whether you're refreshing a guest bath or gutting a master bathroom, our team manages every stage in-house — demolition, waterproofing, plumbing rough-in, tile, fixtures, and trim. We pull all required Delaware County permits and handle inspections from start to finish.</p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" data-magnetic>Request a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-overview__media reveal" data-reveal="right">
          <figure class="svc-overview__figure">
            <img src="/assets/img/proj-window.webp"
                 alt="Interior remodeling project by ProBrothers in Media, PA"
                 loading="lazy" width="768" height="1024" />
            <figcaption>Media, PA Project</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="svc-overview__figure">
            <img src="/assets/img/svc-remodel.webp"
                 alt="Home remodeling services by ProBrothers serving Delaware County"
                 loading="lazy" width="750" height="500" />
            <figcaption>Delaware County Remodel</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Full Gut Renovations ===== -->
  <section class="section svc-why-trim" id="gut-renovations" aria-label="Full Gut Bathroom Renovations" style="background:var(--gray-2)">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <span class="section__kicker">COMPLETE TRANSFORMATION</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">
          FULL GUT BATHROOM RENOVATIONS
          <svg class="blueprint" viewBox="0 0 160 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-why-trim__grid">
        <div class="svc-why-trim__text reveal">
          <p>For homeowners in <a href="/locations/media/">Media, PA</a> and Delaware County who want a complete transformation, ProBrothers handles full gut renovations from the studs out. We demolish the existing bathroom, address any subfloor or moisture issues, and rebuild with new framing, waterproofing, backer board, plumbing rough-in, and electrical — then finish with your choice of tile, fixtures, and materials.</p>
          <p>Full gut renovations are ideal when the existing layout no longer works, when outdated plumbing needs replacement, or when you want to expand the bathroom footprint. We pull all required Delaware County permits and handle inspections from start to finish.</p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" style="margin-top:1rem;display:inline-block" data-magnetic>Get a Free Gut Renovation Quote</a>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="svc-testimonial reveal" data-reveal="right">
          <div class="review__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          <p>&ldquo;ProBrothers gutted our master bathroom down to the studs and rebuilt everything. The tile work is flawless, the frameless glass shower is exactly what we wanted, and they finished on schedule. Highly recommend for any Delaware County homeowner.&rdquo;</p>
          <footer>Sarah M., Newtown Square, PA</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Tile Work ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="tile-flooring-waterproofing" aria-label="Tile Work, Flooring & Waterproofing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <span class="section__kicker">TILE &amp; WATERPROOFING</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">
          TILE WORK, FLOORING &amp; WATERPROOFING
          <svg class="blueprint" viewBox="0 0 160 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-prose reveal">
        <p>Tile selection and installation is one of the most impactful upgrades in any bathroom remodel. ProBrothers installs ceramic, porcelain, natural stone, and large-format tile for shower surrounds, floors, and feature walls. Every wet area is waterproofed with a membrane system before tile is set — no shortcuts that lead to moisture problems later.</p>
        <p>We work with your design preferences: subway tile, hex mosaic, Carrara marble, slate, or modern large-format porcelain. Our team provides in-home consultations so you can visualize the finished result before any work begins. This attention to detail is part of why ProBrothers carries a 5.0 client rating across 135+ Delaware County projects.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Vanity, Shower & Tub ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="vanity-shower-tub" aria-label="Vanity, Shower & Tub Upgrades" style="background:var(--gray-2)">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <span class="section__kicker">FIXTURES &amp; UPGRADES</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">
          VANITY, SHOWER &amp; TUB UPGRADES
          <svg class="blueprint" viewBox="0 0 160 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-prose reveal">
        <p>Whether you're replacing a dated vanity, converting a tub to a walk-in shower, or upgrading to a freestanding soaking tub, ProBrothers manages the full scope — from plumbing rough-in to final fixture installation. We install custom vanities with soft-close cabinetry, frameless glass shower enclosures, rain shower systems, and heated floor mats.</p>
        <p>Popular upgrades in Delaware County homes include: walk-in tiled showers to replace old tub/shower combos, double-sink vanities for master bathrooms, and niche shelving built into shower walls for a clean, spa-like look. These upgrades complement our <a href="/services/remodeling/">full home remodeling</a> work when homeowners want a comprehensive renovation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Accessible Bathroom ===== -->
