            <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-prose reveal">
        <p>ProBrothers converts standard bathrooms to accessible, ADA-friendly spaces for aging-in-place or mobility needs. We install roll-in showers, grab bars, comfort-height toilets, non-slip flooring, and widened doorways. Accessible bathroom conversions in Delaware County typically range from $8,000 to $20,000 depending on scope.</p>
        <p>Our team is experienced with the permit requirements and inspection process for structural modifications in <a href="/locations/media/">Media, PA</a> and surrounding municipalities. We work closely with homeowners and, when needed, occupational therapists to ensure the remodeled space meets functional requirements.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

