            <p>Most bathroom remodels in Media, PA take <strong>3 to 6 weeks</strong> from demolition to final walkthrough. A basic cosmetic update (tile, vanity, fixtures) takes 2&ndash;3 weeks. A full gut renovation &mdash; especially one requiring new plumbing or electrical &mdash; takes 4&ndash;6 weeks. Timeline depends on material lead times, permit approval, and project scope. ProBrothers provides a written project schedule at the start of every job.</p>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" style="--d:.14s">
